    "detailed_description": "Stop Rod is a simple but fun little game.<br />\r\nIn this game you will play as a stop ......rod!<br />\r\nTiming the release of incoming vehicles quickly and accurately.<br />\r\nBe careful not to let anything strange outside of the car pass!<br />\r\nAlthough the game is simple, it's a test of your reflexes.<br />\r\nThrough continuous practice and challenges, let's hit the high score!<br />\r\nPeople on the side of the road will cheer you on!<br />\r\nWhether you're looking to relax in your leisure time or work on your reflexes, this game has you covered.<br />\r\nCome and join the game and experience the fun of being a rod! \uff08\uff1f",
    "about_the_game": "Stop Rod is a simple but fun little game.<br />\r\nIn this game you will play as a stop ......rod!<br />\r\nTiming the release of incoming vehicles quickly and accurately.<br />\r\nBe careful not to let anything strange outside of the car pass!<br />\r\nAlthough the game is simple, it's a test of your reflexes.<br />\r\nThrough continuous practice and challenges, let's hit the high score!<br />\r\nPeople on the side of the road will cheer you on!<br />\r\nWhether you're looking to relax in your leisure time or work on your reflexes, this game has you covered.<br />\r\nCome and join the game and experience the fun of being a rod! \uff08\uff1f",
    "short_description": "After being smashed by a pole in the parking lot, we made this game! The personal lesson reminds everyone, be careful of being hit by the stop rod in the parking lot~",
